### 3. Table Type Decision Matrix

| Scenario | Table Type | Why |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Raw ingestion from files/streams | **Streaming Table** | Append-only, incremental, checkpointed |
| CDC from source database | **Streaming Table + apply_changes** | Handles dedup, ordering, SCD automatically |
| Cleaned/conformed facts | **Streaming Table** (if source is streaming) | Maintains incremental chain |
| Reference/dimension data (latest state) | **Materialized View** | Auto-refreshes, QUALIFY dedup |
| Pre-aggregated summaries | **Materialized View** | Auto-refreshes when upstream changes |
| Complex denormalized table (MERGE logic) | **Managed Table** | Full DML: MERGE, UPDATE, DELETE |
| Shared with external tools | **External Table** | Data stays at your LOCATION; DROP is safe |
| Ad-hoc exploration | **Temporary View** | Session-scoped, no storage |

