### 6. Clustering & Optimization Strategy Per Layer

| Layer | Clustering Strategy | OPTIMIZE Frequency | VACUUM | ANALYZE TABLE |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **Bronze** | `CLUSTER BY (ingestion_date)` or none | Monthly (low-priority) | RETAIN 90 days (replay buffer) | Not needed (rarely queried) |
| **Silver** | `CLUSTER BY (business_date, entity_id)` | Weekly | RETAIN 30 days | After major loads |
| **Gold** | `CLUSTER BY (dashboard_filter_col_1, filter_col_2)` | After each load | RETAIN 7 days | After each load (critical for join strategy) |

